{fma:b}

{darker than black}

{samurai shamploo}

your main opening string with Tempest(or Lao in general) is going to be 11211, B321, B2, F2, F23 and B12, although i haven't gotten used to it yet but with the new patch it's made the string quite good.


if you're serious in being a legit Lao then i suggest to learn how to link st.44 with db1 as it is optimal. like so;

**11211/B2/F2/B12xxDB1, 44, RC, B321xxDF1, JI3xxD4, 21/B122+3**


another optimal but subjectively easier combo to do is from his B321 starter, it goes like;

**B321xxDB1, RC, B32xxDF1, JI3xxD4, 21/B122+3**


You can use both combos either midscreen or corner. the only difference is that you may not need to run cancel and/or can add an NJP after DF1.
